Economic Analysis - Global Economic Trends in Recent Years (Tableau)
Designed and developed an interactive Tableau dashboard showcasing key performance indicators across economic, social, environmental, technological, and military domains.
Analyzed data from 2000 to 2023 to compare national growth, sustainability, and global competitiveness.
Utilized Tableau for dynamic visualizations, enabling insights for research, policy planning, and education.
Featured metrics include GDP, literacy rates, CO₂ emissions, internet usage, and defense spending.
